{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archlyphion: Migration</strong> is a 2D-pixel side-scrolling runner game about a Beanie<strong>\u2014</strong>a species of small puppylike dinosaurs that must navigate its way to the other side of The Archlyphion Maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within it, everything that are usually found across different points of time live under the same universe together, progressing from the <strong>prehistoric</strong>  to the <strong>futuristic</strong>. You will only be told through the limited lens of this particular little traveller who wakes up to find that their herd has fled away from the fire in their habitat, and have possibly migrated to the future eras ahead of them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/bab88b5dce39792e2229ea66cc3c3c42.poster.avif?t=1755180351\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/bab88b5dce39792e2229ea66cc3c3c42.webm?t=1755180351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/bab88b5dce39792e2229ea66cc3c3c42.mp4?t=1755180351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, the migration journey has begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27d0 Animated Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring\u00a0hand-drawn pixel art<strong>,</strong> <strong>animated cutscenes</strong> narrate the life of a Beanie relative to The Maze. Watch as it escapes from its home before ending with an early access encounter of a mysterious resident of the next era...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/70a92b697c16c73b78239a64e0c59611.poster.avif?t=1755180351\" width=616 height=173 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/70a92b697c16c73b78239a64e0c59611.webm?t=1755180351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27d0 Survive the Duration of the Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, clear incoming obstacles by jumping over them or consuming them at a perfect timing. The latter turns them into <strong>projectiles</strong>, which may be crucial especially for whatever danger awaits at the end of the stage's duration...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/bebcdaa747e91e8dfc45a3b0b801cc6a.poster.avif?t=1755180351\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/bebcdaa747e91e8dfc45a3b0b801cc6a.webm?t=1755180351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27d0 Eat and Travel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose its next destination. When it is ready to run, <strong>feed the Beanie</strong> with objects collected from its previous successful run so that Time may bless it to ensure its ongoing survival...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/ad6eaf11f08e39cb6e0c76e108dd1f99.poster.avif?t=1755180351\" width=616 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/extras/ad6eaf11f08e39cb6e0c76e108dd1f99.webm?t=1755180351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27d0 Endless Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode can be unlocked in the title screen after completing the introductory stage, as though alluding to this <strong>one particular offline dinosaur game</strong> the outsiders seem to be well-familiar of...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***These visual cutscenes may differ slightly in the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27d0 Early Access Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, this early access contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 running stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 possible achievements (2 from the run stages, 4 outside of it)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 in-game soundtracks composed by the creator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-20 minutes of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO save system! Therefore, it is recommended to play through it in one session.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any suggestions and feedback, please reach out to the creator's socials or by email.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725380?t=1755180351","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/664eeb34f073f0313c59f0d2b0e4dad7f8bf0793/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755180351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/65c32ee0e0dad99182cd8ad3fad5d76c57774423/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755180351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/65c32ee0e0dad99182cd8ad3fad5d76c57774423/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755180351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"deta