tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725380/c747486292be8e8091636efcbd760567cc6a9518/ss_c747486292be8e8091636efcbd760567cc6a9518.600x338.jpg?t=1755180351"}],"short_description":"Archlyphion: Migration tells a story of a lone Beanie who, after a fire broke out in their habitat, must make a run for it. Perhaps the herd is waiting at the other side of The Maze, but not before it stumbles across other eras\u00a0along the way. Will it have what it takes to survive the odds?","steam_appid":3725380,"support_info":{"email":"strlite.art@gmail.com","url":"https://str-lite-art.carrd.co/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://str-lite-art.carrd.co/"}